1. RPKI validation: The ROA for 44.192.0.0/16 authorizes AS-AWS as the origin with max-length /24. While your announcement preserves AS-AWS as the origin AS in the AS_PATH, RPKI validates the *origin AS* — it does not authorize AS-LEGITAS to transit this prefix. RPKI does not certify that you have a legitimate business relationship with AWS or the right to carry this prefix.

